       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is unsafe as written.\n\n- **Single dose:** 2000 mg is double the usual maximum of 1000 mg per dose.\n- **Daily total:** 2000 mg three times daily is 6,000 mg/day. The usual adult maximum is 4,000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day. Going over that risks serious hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1000 mg by mouth three times daily** (3,000 mg/day)\n- **1000 mg by mouth four times daily** (4,000 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **650 mg by mouth every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day)\n\nTell me which one you want, or confirm the dose if 2000 mg three times daily was intended. If you confirm it, I'll need a clinical rationale for the order note. I'll enter the order once I hear back."
